  {
    "field_name": "Profile Parameter Values",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Parameters_SmokeBaselineExtend",
    "value": "{\"num_gpus\": {\"smoke\": \"1\", \"baseline\": \"1\", \"extended\": \"1\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"collective\": {\"smoke\": \"all\", \"baseline\": \"all\", \"extended\": \"all\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"min_bytes\": {\"smoke\": \"8\", \"baseline\": \"8\", \"extended\": \"8\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"max_bytes\": {\"smoke\": \"1024\", \"baseline\": \"16777216\", \"extended\": \"16777216\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"step_factor\": {\"smoke\": \"2\", \"baseline\": \"2\", \"extended\": \"2\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"warmup_iters\": {\"smoke\": \"1\", \"baseline\": \"5\", \"extended\": \"10\", \"notes\": \"\"}, \"num_iterations\": {\"smoke\": \"2\", \"baseline\": \"480000\", \"extended\": \"620000\", \"notes\": \"00_75 H100 20260905: collector uses min_bytes only; 600000 inner iters is still ~10s on 1 GPU. Duration is overlay rounds smoke=1 / baseline=20 / extended=48. | 2026-09-11 GARY_LEDGER (runtime_ledger_201_232): baseline (600000 iters, no prior retune) measured 2:09/2:13/2:16 (avg 2:13) across 3 live loop runs against a 'make at least 3 min' target. Rate ~4524 iters/s. Scaled 600000 x (240/133) ~= 1.1e6 to retarget ~4 min baseline. Extended not flagged -- left unchanged. Unconfirmed by a fresh run. | 2026-09-24: collector now sweeps min_bytes..max_bytes (was min_bytes only) with iterations scaled per size; repeat rounds halved to baseline 10 / extended 24 to hold duration. num_iterations is the per-sweep budget at min_bytes. Re-time on the next run. | 2026-09-28 GARY_LEDGER (aggregated_runtime_ledgers_101_201_301_401_20260928_9am; targets baseline 3-5 min, extended 8-15 min): 1100000/1520000 -> 480000/850000. baseline 1.1e6 measured 7:45/7:51, extended 1.52e6 measured 19:49/21:02 (overlay rounds 10/24). Chosen between the linear scale and the two-point fit (~141 s fixed): baseline predicted 3:30-4:45, extended 11:20-12:30. Unconfirmed by a fresh run.\"}}"
  },
